      "instance_name": "man_on_left",
      "label": "Black man in suit",
      "description": "A Black man wearing a dark suit, standing in a physical struggle with another man. His facial expression appears tense or defensive as he is being grabbed by the collar. He is the subject of the racial stereotype being referenced in the meme text.",
